nor that compels you to "]],[401,0,["challenge me."]],[247,0,[]],[241,0,[{"name":"Tense Battle","volume":100,"pitch":100}]],[101,0,["\\bFine, then!\\nShow me your best!"]],[355,0,["$stats.gym_leader_attempts[0] += 1"]],[111,0,[12,"TrainerBattle.start(:LEADER_Brock, \"Brock\")"]],[248,1,[]],[101,1,["\\bAs proof of your victory, I confer on you this...the "]],[401,1,["official Pokémon League Boulder Badge."]],[101,1,["\\me[Obtained a Badge]\\bYou've earned the Boulder "]],[401,1,["Badge."]],[401,1,["\\wtnp[110]"]],[355,1,["$stats.set_time_to_badge(0)"]],[655,1,["$player.badges[0] = true"]],[101,1,["\\bJust having the Boulder Badge makes your "]],[401,1,["Pokémon more powerful."]],[101,1,["\\bIt also enables the use of the move Flash outside of "]],[401,1,["battle."]],[101,1,["\\bOf course, a Pokémon must know the move Flash "]],[401,1,["to use it."]],[101,1,["\\bWait!\\nTake this with you."]],[355,1,["pbReceiveItem(:TM39)"]],[101,1,["\\bA TM, Technical Machine, contains a technique for "]],[401,1,["Pokémon."]],[101,1,["\\bUsing a TM teaches the move it contains to a "]],[401,1,["Pokémon."]],[101,1,["\\bA TM is good for only one use."]],[101,1,["\\bSo, when you use one, pick the Pokémon carefully."]],[101,1,["\\bAnyways...\\nTM39 contains Rock Tomb."]],[101,1,["\\bIt hurls boulders at the foe and lowers its Speed."]],[121,1,[83,83,0]],[0,1,[]],[412,0,[]],[0,0,[]]]},{"cond":{"s1":83,"s2":0,"v":0,"vv":0,"self":null},"gfx":{"name":"trainer_LEADER_Brock","hue":0,"dir":2,"pattern":0,"opacity":255,"blend":0,"tile":0},"moveType":0,"moveSpeed":3,"moveFreq":3,"route":{"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"list":[]},"walkAnime":true,"stepAnime":false,"dirFix":false,"through":false,"onTop":false,"trigger":0,"list":[[101,0,["\\bThere are all kinds of Trainers in this huge world of "]],[401,0,["ours."]],[101,0,["\\bYou appear to be very gifted as a Pokémon Trainer."]],[101,0,["\\bSo let me make a suggestion."]],[101,0,["\\bGo to the Gym in Cerulean and test your abilities."]],[0,0,[]]]}